# 2. Reference Tables

## Episode boundary markers

These behaviors are coder-inserted **dividers**, not scored behaviors -- they
exist only to mark where Baseline, Still Face, and Reunion begin and end (this
is what you'd started building in the `time_helper` chunk). They're excluded
from all duration/count scoring.

```{r boundary-markers}
BOUNDARY_MARKERS <- c(
  "BASELINE 15 S REUNION NO COPE",
  "15 S NO INFANT VOCAL",
  "15 S NO FACIAL EXPRESSION",
  "15 S STILL FACE NO AFFECT",
  "15 S STILL FACE NO GAZE",
  "15 S STILL FACE NO TALKING/TOUCHING",
  "REUNION TRANSITION NO EXPRESSION",
  "REUNION TRANSITION NO VOCAL"
)
```

## Scored behavior reference

