whichever of Baseline (`1`), Still Face (`2`), and Reunion (`3`) the score
sheet actually names it in -- most constructs skip Still Face, a handful
(Object/Parent Orientation, Comforting, Escape) exist *only* at Still Face,
per the original score sheet's `NA` cells (see Section 2). This is a direct
line-by-line match to the score sheet table: **if a variable name needs to
change, this is the first place to look** -- find the current name below
(they're unique and greppable) and edit it in place; nothing else in the
